<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Blackmores half yr net rises 25 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Blackmores half yr net rises 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     3.45 vs 2.63</p>
<p>    Net					2.00 vs 1.60</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     8.00 vs 6.00</p>
<p>    Sales				   30.85 vs 30.98</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 pct franked</p>
<p>Pay date Mar 20</p>
<p>Reg date Mar 7</p>
<p>    Tax					1.35 vs 0.77</p>
<p>    Interest				 0.10 vs 0.26</p>
<p>NOTE: Blackmores Ltd is a health products maker.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
